[Music]  hi mystery recapped here today i am  going to explain a hong kong chinese  culinary drama film called cook up a  storm spoilers ahead watch out and take  care  the movie centers around a famous local  restaurant named the seven in spring  avenue hong kong the talented chef of  the restaurant sky co specializes in  southern style cuisine a tv host  features the 30 year old restaurant and  its chef on a culinary program skye  shows his talent on national television  even though he is already popular as the  best chef in all of spring avenue  alongside him his friend uni is also  introduced to the people she usually  manages the financial aspect of the  restaurant skye is very definitive about  the quality of food and time they  provide to their customers which is part  of the reason why their restaurant is so  popular most of the time it is so packed  that a queue of people has to line up  outside the restaurant that day a rude  customer barges in after breaking up the  queue skye refuses to serve him even  though the customer boasts about the  power and money he possesses before  leaving the man laughs at their small  restaurant and discloses that his boss  has invited a world-class chef to open a  three-star restaurant opposite to theirs  the thought scares yuni but she  dismisses it as a bluff meanwhile in  france the crowned king and queen are  welcoming their newborn son they hold a  massive ball to celebrate the birth and  invite a world-class chef to cook for  the guests we are introduced to the said  chef paul ahn he is a michelin-starred  korean chef trained in france paul has a  special way of cooking that doesn't see  boundaries in one particular style he  loves to mix cuisines from different  countries and thus create innovative  dishes for the chef's special he  presents the queen with a dessert that  looks like a red egg but is filled with  mango puree and coconuts gross the dish  is inspired by the tradition that  symbolizes red eggs as a blessing to the  newborn the delicious dish and the  meaning behind it touched the royals  hearts and they applaud paul's brilliant  work after the successful ball he and  his assistant myo return to the  restaurant that they currently work for  the owner and their co-workers welcomed  them with cheers congratulating them on  their success the owner also announces  that they have promoted paul to the  executive chef of the whole art nouveau  franchise this step is a huge one for  him however to everyone's surprise he  declines the offer paul wants to return  to asia and pursue a bigger and higher  ambition he and mayo have been invited  by a chinese businessman who wants to  open a three-star restaurant the staff  supports their decision and wishes them  farewell back on spring avenue one of  skye's regular customers informs him  that the rumor about the new restaurant  being established is true the news is  bittersweet for skye because he wants  his small colony to develop but a new  restaurant would mean fewer customers  and more competition when skye was 10  years old his father used to hit him and  insult him for having no talent as a  cook one day he abandoned skye and chose  to pursue his culinary career over being  a father with the excuse being that skye  couldn't even make a decent bowl of  noodles imagine your dad leaving because  of noodles ever since uncle seven the  master and owner of the seven  restaurants has taken care of him he  also taught skye everything that he  needed to know about food unlike his  father currently sky hasn't met his  father in over 20 years and has no plan  to reconcile with him the following  morning paul arrives in hong kong and  goes to the market in search of a big  grouper fish the seller has only one of  the fish and decides to sell it to sky  knowing that he will cook it better paul  argues insisting that a shopkeeper  shouldn't be biased they get into a  small argument before the seller cuts  the fish in half for both of them a few  weeks later is the opening ceremony of  the three-star restaurant named stellar  that is right in front of the seven  restaurant the chairman and manager of  the lee management group arrives as the  first guests of the restaurant and are  welcomed by paul and mayo at the same  time the people from the seven  restaurants start announcing different  discount offers they're offering for the  next week when the security guards from  the stellar restaurant try to stop them  a conflict arises this attracts paul and  the guests attention making them come  out to see what the fuss is about when  the conversation gets heated maya  suggests they hold a competition to see  which cook is better skye and paul  recognize each other from the market and  accept the challenge they decide to  indulge in a fish cutting competition  paul goes first and skillfully picks all  of the ribs from a fish in no time  following that sky takes the same fish  and cuts it into even pieces in under a  minute the crowd claps for him and even  paul is impressed the chairman of the  league group has to announce the results  in an unbiased way he claims that the  true results will only be announced in  the international chef challenge  competition that both chefs have taken  part in he also announces that he is  planning to take over the entire spring  avenue colony to remove all of the  buildings and modernize it if sky wins  in the competition the chairman is  willing to withdraw his plan to preserve  the heritage of the colony however if  paul wins he will go through with the  plan with the future of the entire  colony in his hands skye feels pressured  but still he is determined to do his  best for the next few days the number of  customers at the seven restaurant  decreases uni is worried that they might  soon go out of business but sky assures  her that is not possible he gives her  the example of escargot and field snails  claiming that there will always be  people who like one more than the other  they do not have to change their food to  be better than the stellar restaurant  because there will always be customers  who like theirs better the following day  skye is met with disappointment when he  goes to the market and finds out that  the stellar restaurant has bought all  the good fish the day is frustrating for  the workers in the seven restaurant  until they find out that skye has been  selected for the culinary competition he  will soon go against paul to be selected  for the semifinals but then it is also  announced that the victor will have to  go against the two-time winner of the  competition mountain co sky is shocked  to see that his father has achieved the  success he wanted to he is now even more  determined to reach the finals and  compete against him that night seven  returns home from his trip and calls sky  to a pub excited to meet him after so  long skye runs to the location but finds  his father with uncle seven mountain  bluntly says that he still doesn't  believe in sky and doesn't regret  leaving him for his career the words are  the most hurtful thing skye has ever  heard but he hides his pain with anger  he promises to win the competition and  prove that being a good cook doesn't  require being a bad person like mountain  is on the day of the culinary duel the  contestants get 90 minutes to cook a  dish of their choice and present it skye  makes a traditional salt-baked duck  while paul makes a foie gras or bay the  entire 90 minutes are intense as both  cooks show great expertise while cooking  their respective dishes sky cuts the  ducks insides with little to no effort  and pulls them out efficiently making  the audience gasp in the end he bakes  the duck in salt and breaks the  additional layer to reveal a well-cooked  duck with vegetable stuffings the judges  try it and seem to be more impressed by  skye's duck than paul's sorbet when it  is time to vote paul receives three  nines and a whopping 10 out of 10  scoring a total of 37 points right after  skye receives two tens from the first  two judges the third judge gives him a  nine but the last judge only gives him  an eight because both chefs have tied in  points the head judge makes the  executive decision to make paul the  winner because his dish presentation was  superior to skye's bland plating  although paul's victory should have  solidified his abilities as a cook  things did not go as expected while  celebrating their victory the manager  informs paul that he wants to replace  him with mayo to compete in the finals  according to him a woman is more  appealing in the media than a man when  paul tries to defend his position as  head chef maya exposes that he has  difficulty tasting certain flavors like  saltiness for the past few months he has  been using a notebook containing all his  recipes to cook and can do nothing on  his own maya also discloses that she  never wanted to befriend paul and only  sided with him to surpass him as a chef  betrayed and hurt paul storms out of the  restaurant never to look back that night  skye bumps into a drunk paw in front of  an event stadium they forget about their  rivalry for a few minutes and share  their past and troubles paul reveals  that his father was a great chef and his  dying wish was for paul to be like him  skye also tells him about his and  mountain's relationship after the  conversation they find mutual respect  for each other they also throw bottles  of alcohol at mountain's picture on a  billboard while cursing at him in korean  paul doesn't want to give up on the  competition yet since he cannot take  part as a representative of the stellar  restaurant he decides to participate as  an individual chef after debunking the  rule book he even asks skye to join him  for the semifinals at the same time the  manager of stellar is at the seven  restaurant urging uncle seven to sign  away his restaurant to the league group  right then paul and skye appear and  announce their partnership paul also  reminds the manager that as the winner  of the competition he is eligible to  compete at the championship for the next  few weeks skye and paul work and train  together they try each other's styles of  cooking and reach a common ground of  modernization of traditional cuisine the  semi-final of the culinary competition  takes place at the studio city casino in  macau the one to win the round will have  to face the current god of cookery  mountain co the competition starts and  skye and paul use both their culinary  strengths to compete against four other  great chefs from different parts of the  world somehow the league group has also  made mayo take part in the competition  she cooks extra carefully to prove that  she is better than paul she makes an  oyster dish with frozen foam that the  judges compliment initially but on being  served they seem to find it mediocre  meanwhile paul and skye create a  deconstructed mapo tofu skye's sense of  taste helps determine the flavor of  ingredients while paul's understanding  of the culinary artistry helps with the  techniques and processes used together  they create a traditional dish with a  modern design the judges compliment the  dish in detail thoroughly impressed by  it in the end they win the competition  and reach the finale as everyone cheers  paul looks at mayo who stands with her  head low ashamed that she betrayed him  and couldn't prove herself for the final  round only one of the chefs can compete  against mountain paul thinks that  because of his lack of taste he is  ineligible to participate he knows that  skye's desire to beat mountain is a very  personal one hence he suggests sky face  mountain in the finals the following day  skye stands face to face with his father  the competition asks them to cook  anything they want in an hour the father  and son do not share words before the  competition starts mountain immediately  begins to cook but skye is distracted by  his thoughts he remembers how mountain  abandoned him and how much the people in  the neighborhood mean to him the  thoughts overwhelm sky and he can hardly  focus to get him to come back to his  senses mountain splashes water at his  son's face the action brings skye back  and he immediately starts making dough  by the end of the hour mountain makes an  aesthetic sugar display of molten lava  with a flower on top in contrast skye's  dish is a bit more simple but personal  he makes noodles like the noodles that  mountain made years ago before  abandoning his son the judges try  mountain's dish and are impressed by it  however skye never hands his dish to  them  instead he gives the bowl of noodles to  mountain mountain eats it and is moved  as he remembers what the noodles  represent at last he has no choice but  to acknowledge his son's brilliance in  culinary art the winner of the  competition is unclear but the judges  never got to taste the food in the  following scene we see a crowd has  gathered outside the seven restaurant to  celebrate the chinese new year they  enjoy a meal cooked by skye and paul  together as a family subscribe for more  videos like this turn on notifications  and leave a like to help the channel out  thank you for watching

